OL,3,GNEWSADevastated golf club partially
OL,4,Areopens after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA golf club which was devastated by
OL,7,Flast week's fires has partially
OL,8,Freopened, but it could cost more than
OL,9,F#1m to fully restore it.
OL,11,FSimon Markey, the chairman of
OL,12,FStourbridge Golf Club, said it has
OL,13,Freceived a huge amount of offers of
OL,14,Fsupport and help, and six holes should
OL,15,Fbe open to members again on Saturday.
OL,17,FBut he confirmed that the remaining
OL,18,Fholes were "devastated" by the fire,
OL,19,Falong with hundreds of trees, 600m of
OL,20,Fhedgerow and a storage building.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
