OL,3,GNEWSADevastated golf club partially
OL,4,Areopens after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarkey also lives nearby and said
OL,7,Fseeing the flames reach within 50ft of
OL,8,Fhis gates was "one of the scariest
OL,9,Fthings that I've ever witnessed".
